### Library Management API - Fines Settlement
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Login as Member
# @name loginMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member@library.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@memberToken = {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login as Librarian
# @name loginLibrarian
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@library.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@librarianToken = {{loginLibrarian.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. View My Fines
GET {{baseUrl}}/fines/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 2. Settle / Pay Fine (Librarian Action)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fines/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
